WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES AND DOES NOT COVER

This licence covers the software in this repository: the translator, the
liblouis tables, the verification tools, the website and the documentation.

It does not cover Standard Sindhi Braille itself. That code was authored and
ratified on 7 November 2016 by a committee of the Sindhi Language Authority,
Government of Sindh, Pakistan, and it belongs to them. Nothing here alters it.
The letter-to-cell tables in official-code/ are a machine-readable record of
that standard, published so the software can be checked against it.

The reference tables in brailleTables/reference/ are liblouis's own work by
other authors and carry their own copyright notices and licences. See
brailleTables/reference/NOTICE.md.
